        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FP227, Solid Brass Rectangular Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis well designed solid brass flush door pull is for use on pocket doors, sliding doors, cabinet doors. It has a 1/2 inch depth so there is plenty of room for big hands to get a good hold. Easy to install, it comes packaged with matching finish mounting screws. Flush pull like the 3-5/8 Inch Rectangular Cup Pull are mortised into the door for a sleek, clean appearance. It is especially good in area where there is little to no clearance for a pull with a big projection.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FP227-Specifications.gif?v=1704354552\" width=\"356\" height=\"248\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana FP227 Flush Rectangular Door Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FP227 Solid Brass Rectangular Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Cutout Depth: 15/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Cutout Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cutout Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 1/32\" Thick Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FP227.pdf?v=1704262160\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana FP227  Dimensions  Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "3-5/8 Inch Rectangular Cup Pull | Deltana FP227",
                "description": "Flush Rectangular Pocket Door Pull Deltana FP227 - This well designed solid brass flush door pull is for use on pocket doors, sliding doors, cabinet doors. It has a 1/2 inch depth so there is plenty of room for big hands to get a good hold. Easy to install, it comes packaged with matching finish mounting screws. Flush pull like the 3-5/8 Inch Rectangular Cup Pull are mortised into the door for a sleek, clean appearance. It is especially good in area where there is little to no clearance for a pull with a big projection. ",
